Bizzlo Commission & Payments SOP

This downloadable working SOP explains the partner finance workflow inside Bizzlo.

Stages:
- Projected: application may become commission-bearing.
- Ready to invoice: offer/deposit condition reached.
- Invoiced: Videshway finance has raised the partner invoice.
- Paid: partner commission has been released.

Commercial rates are intentionally not included in the portal resource library.
